# CI-only Bazel settings. Loaded explicitly by the CI workflow
# (`bazel --bazelrc=.bazelrc.ci ...`); it is NOT auto-imported, so a local
# `bazel test //...` still runs every target.
#
# Skip `local_only`-tagged tests in CI. They vmap the zorch.fused_region
# composite, which needs the CompositeOp op + frx#164 batching rule that only
# the composite-capable dev frxlib carries — CI runs the published wheel, which
# lacks both. Run these locally against that dev frxlib. Drop this filter (and
# the tags) once the published frx pin carries the composite backport.
test --test_tag_filters=-local_only
